Module LAPT_1RB1RC_1LC1RA_1RA0LD_0RB1LD.
(** * LAPT_1RB1RC_1LC1RA_1RA0LD_0RB1LD: TRANSITION-LEVEL board for machine 1RB1RC_1LC1RA_1RA0LD_0RB1LD, boarded by CERTIFICATE.

