Module LAPT_1RB1RC_1LC1RA_1RA0LD_0RC1LD.
(** * LAPT_1RB1RC_1LC1RA_1RA0LD_0RC1LD: TRANSITION-LEVEL board for machine 1RB1RC_1LC1RA_1RA0LD_0RC1LD, boarded by CERTIFICATE.

    Auto-emitted by tools/counters/emit_lapcert.py (UNTRUSTED emitter; the Coq
