    apply (fire_via_ovf_lift tm Cc Hi (StC, S1)).
    intros p1 j1 E1. apply (fire_lift_of_csteps tm Cc).
    apply (fireo_1RB1RD_1LB0LC_0RD1LC_1RA0LC [SCycL 2 0; SWin 2; SWinL 4] (StC, S1) ltac:(vm_compute; reflexivity)
                   p1 j1 E1).
