  - exists (4 * j + 8), (cden [] [] j BB1_1RB1RD_1LB1RC_0RD1LC_1RA0LC).
    split; [lia|]. split; [| exact (gbo_1RB1RD_1LB1RC_0RD1LC_1RA0LC j)].
