                   p1 j1 E1).
Qed.

Theorem nqhtr_1RB1RD_1LC0LB_1RA0LB_0RD0LA : NeverQuasiHaltsTr tm_1RB1RD_1LC0LB_1RA0LB_0RD0LA.
